  "id": "lookup_member_savings_balance",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Look up a member's savings balance",
  "description": "Signs on to the Northpoint FCU Meridian Core Servicing Console, searches the Member Search panel by Member ID, and reads the member's Savings account current balance from the Accounts table on the Member Detail screen. Returns savingsBalance (money), plus memberId, memberName and memberStatus for verification. Read-only: it performs no transactions and changes no records.",
